          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaka wa ĩkũmĩ na mũonza wa kũsumbĩka kwa Veka mwana wa Lemalia, Aasu mwana wa Yothamu mũsumbĩ wa Yuta ambĩlĩlya kũsumbĩka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.1.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 1.9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aasu aĩ wa myaka mĩongo ĩlĩ yĩla wambĩlĩlye kũsumbĩka; na asumbĩka myaka ĩkũmi na thanthatũ Yelusaleme: na ndaaĩka ũla Yeova wonaa wĩ ũseo, o tondũ Ndaviti ĩthe wake wekaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
