            "sid": "2KI 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ĩndĩ nĩwaendaa mũendelenĩ wa asumbĩ ma Isilaeli, ĩĩ, na avĩtĩlya mwana wake mwakinĩ, kwĩanana na mothatyo ma mbaĩ, ila Yeova wailũngilye mbee wa ana ma Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
