          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwondũ wa ũu Aasu atũma atũmwa kwa Tikilathi‐vileseli mũsumbĩ wa Asuli, akĩmwĩa, Nyie nĩ mũthũkũmi waku na mwana waku: ambata, ũndangĩĩe kuma kw’okonĩ kwa mũsumbĩ wa Silia, na kuma kw’okonĩ kwa mũsumbĩ wa Isilaeli, ala mambũkĩlĩĩle mokite nakwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
